# OPEN HOUSE: drummers pay 1, 4, 9, 16 together; a paparazzo collects a
# guest's pay at once (a drummer's is the whole band's) and it pays again at
# the end.
game openhouse
wait 5
cheat new 1 1
cheat give 13 4
cheat cap 8
cheat door 13
expect vpop0 == 1
cheat door 13
expect vpop0 == 2
expect vpop1 == 2
cheat door 13 13
expect vpop3 == 4
cheat end
expect pop == 16
cheat new 1 1
cheat give 13 3
cheat give 18 1
cheat cap 8
cheat door 13 13 13 18
cheat act 3 0
expect got_pop == 9
expect pop == 9
cheat end
expect pop == 12
expect penalty == 7
